k coffee with milk.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_triangle_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_triangle_01_12","text":"Otherwise, I'll have an upset stomach.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_triangle_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_triangle_01_13","text":"Why didn't you buy me a different blend of coffee?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_triangle_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_triangle_01_14","text":"Now, I don't know what to do with this. I can't drink it!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_triangle_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_triangle_01_15","text":"???","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_triangle_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_triangle_01_16","text":"It's not me!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_triangle_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_triangle_01_17","text":"Then who?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_triangle_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_triangle_01_18","text":"How should I know?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_triangle_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_triangle_01_19","text":"You always treat others nicely without letting them know.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_triangle_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_triangle_01_20","text":"And you'd get angry if they found out, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_triangle_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_triangle_01_21","text":"Seriously, it's not me!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_triangle_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"privaty","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_triangle_01_22","text":"I NEVER did such a thing!!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_triangle_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"yulha","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_triangle_01_23","text":"See?","jump":null},{"id